{"id":"eb52618778abed91","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-kc-set.md","title":"Kraft–Chaitin Request Sets","display":"df-kc-set — Kraft–Chaitin Request Sets","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-kc-set","aliases":["43-df-kc-set"],"display":"df-kc-set — Kraft–Chaitin Request Sets","depends_on":["[[43-df-string]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 6.6.1 and definition of KC set","source_printed_pages":"100–101","source_pdf_pages":"120–121","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-kc-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-kc-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kc-set — Kraft–Chaitin Request Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 6.6.1 and definition of KC set"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"100–101"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"120–121"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\times\\Sigma^*\">\\(r:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\times\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\operatorname{dom}r\">\\(I=\\operatorname{dom}r\\)</span>；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\ell_i,\\tau_i)=r(i)\">\\((\\ell_i,\\tau_i)=r(i)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(\\ell_i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_i\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\tau_i\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a> 的部分函数编码接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wt}(r)\\in[0,+\\infty]\">\\(\\operatorname{wt}(r)\\in[0,+\\infty]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KC}\">\\(\\mathrm{KC}\\)</span> 是下式定义的谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wt}(r)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i\\in I}2^{-\\ell_i},\\qquad\\mathrm{KC}(r)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Computable}(r)\\land\\operatorname{wt}(r)\\le1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{wt}(r)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i\\in I}2^{-\\ell_i},\\qquad\\mathrm{KC}(r)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Computable}(r)\\land\\operatorname{wt}(r)\\le1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>索引化保留重复请求的质量；把请求当作无重数集合会错误地少算权重。有限、无限和空请求族均允许。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 6.6.1 and definition of KC set；印刷页 100–101，PDF 页 120–121。来源定位沿用附件；此次修订核查形式化与内部一致性，未重新核对原书 PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-string]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$r:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\times\\Sigma^*$，$I=\\operatorname{dom}r$；对每个 $i\\in I$，$(\\ell_i,\\tau_i)=r(i)$，其中 $\\ell_i\\in\\mathbb N$、$\\tau_i\\in\\Sigma^*$。$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 采用 [[43-df-computable]] 的部分函数编码接口。$\\operatorname{wt}(r)\\in[0,+\\infty]$；$\\mathrm{KC}$ 是下式定义的谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"r:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\times\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"I=\\operatorname{dom}r","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"(\\ell_i,\\tau_i)=r(i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_i\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_i\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{wt}(r)\\in[0,+\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{wt}(r)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i\\in I}2^{-\\ell_i},\\qquad\\mathrm{KC}(r)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Computable}(r)\\land\\operatorname{wt}(r)\\le1.","display":true}],"bytes":1558,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-kc-set]] — Kraft–Chaitin Request Sets"},{"id":"0ddb46b76e3779a0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$r:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\times\\Sigma^*$，$I=\\operatorname{dom}r$，对 $i\\in I$ 记 $r(i)=(\\ell_i,\\tau_i)$，且满足 [[43-df-kc-set]] 的 $\\mathrm{KC}(r)$。$K$ 采用 [[43-df-prefixkolm]]。"},{"id":"64c95058f34a7a9b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$r:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\times\\Sigma^*$，$I=\\operatorname{dom}r$，对 $i\\in I$ 记 $r(i)=(\\ell_i,\\tau_i)$；$\\mathrm{KC}$ 见 [[43-df-kc-set]]。$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 采用 [[43-df-computable]] 的部分函数接口；$p:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*$；其定义域条件在断言中给出。$\\mathrm{PrefixFreeMachine}$ 采用 [[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]。"}],"outgoing":["1cb4649e6af56ba4","f357216a7edb035a"]}